<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Driver Created - DT1 Logistics</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; background: #f5f7fa; padding: 20px; }
    .box { background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; max-width: 480px; margin: 40px auto; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
    h1 { color: #1B365D; }
    .temp { background: #fff3cd; padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px; font-family: monospace; font-size: 18px; margin: 16px 0; }
    a { color: #1B365D; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="box">
    <h1>Driver Created</h1>
    <p><strong><%= name %></strong> has been added.</p>
    <p>Email / Username: <strong><%= email %></strong></p>
    <p>Temporary Password:</p>
    <div class="temp"><%= tempPassword %></div>
    <p>Provide this temporary password to the driver. They will be required to change it on first login.</p>
    <form method="POST" action="/drivers/<%= driverId %>/send-welcome" style="margin-top:20px;">
      <button type="submit" style="background:#2E5984;color:white;padding:12px 20px;border:none;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;">Send Welcome Login to Driver</button>
    </form>
    <p><a href="/drivers">← Back to Drivers</a></p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
